        "description": "[\"Breviary: Readings and Responsories.\\nWritten in the Alemannic area, presumably in Switzerland.\\nParchment (rather coarse), 13 long lines; ruling not discernible; pricking in the outer margin. Written in a late, crude Caroline minuscule with squarish Alemannic features; dark brown ink. Plain initials in red or stroked with red; initials in the text slashed with yellow; rubrics in red majuscule; neumes of St. Gall type.\\nUsed for binding; folio 1 used as a pastedown: the verso is stained and rubbed.\\nff. 1, 2 and 3 from the same manuscript.\"]",
